  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，用心製作。支援 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 的大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自動補種作物是一款極簡主義的模組，它會在收成作物後自動用掉落物中的種子進行補種。預設情況下，玩家必須手持鋤頭才能觸發自動補種，但此設定可在配置中調整。按住潛行鍵則可暫時避免補種。<br><br>4.0 版本新增支援擴展了 CropBlock 的模組作物。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於原版體驗整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的生活品質合輯\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldHoeForReplanting</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，玩家必須手持鋤頭才能自動補種作物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於小麥、胡蘿蔔、馬鈴薯、甜菜根、地獄疙瘩、可可豆以及各種模組作物。</strong></span></span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/j.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>可同時收成任意數量的作物，掉落物會自動用於補種下方的作物。</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/g.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"848\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按住潛行鍵時，作物將不會被補種。在清空農田時非常實用！</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/h.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同樣適用於地獄疙瘩與可可豆：</strong><br></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/i.webp\" alt=\"gif3\" width=\"846\" height=\"392\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可自由地將此模組用於任何模組包，但下載檔案必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立模組頁面上逐一追蹤留言，因此留言功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
